{
    "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.CustomBlockManifest",
    "name": "Trade Area Summary",
    "scriptFilename": "script.py",
    "language": "PYTHON",
    "executableVersion": null,
    "minVersions": [
        null
    ],
    "optionsVersion": 1,
    "apiVersion": "VERSION_0",
    "isResourceIntensiveScript": false,
    "showPartitioning": false,
    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "description": "Counts and sums points within several radii of each site, with exclusive and shared catchment, and the nearest site and distance band per point.",
    "category": "Analytics",
    "subcategory": "Geo",
    "tags": [
        "trade area",
        "catchment",
        "radius",
        "haversine",
        "store network",
        "geo",
        "location analytics",
        "visokio-agents"
    ],
    "introductoryText": "For each **site** (store, branch, depot, clinic, school), how many **points** (customers, households, competitors, incidents) lie within each of several **radii**, what value they carry, and how much of that is **shared with other sites**.\n\n- Great-circle (haversine) distances in kilometres or miles, from latitude and longitude\n- Per site and radius: points and value within, share of all points and value, **exclusive** points (no other site within the same radius), shared points, average distance\n- Per point: **nearest site** and distance, a **distance band** (0-1 km, 1-3 km...), and how many sites reach it within the largest radius\n\nConnect the sites to input 1 and the points to input 2. Rows without valid coordinates are kept and marked. Find Nearest gives the k nearest sites per point; this block summarises catchments by radius.",
    "dependencies": "",
    "options": [
        {
            "name": "site_field",
            "title": "Site name",
            "description": "Names each site, such as a store or branch.",
            "groupTitle": "Sites (input 1)",
